OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry this
OL,6,Fevening with some sunny spells and
OL,7,Fremaining dry overnight with clear
OL,8,Fspells. Variable amounts of cloud,
OL,9,Fmainly in the west and light winds for
OL,10,Fall.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA bright start, particularly
OL,13,Fin the east of the region. Cloudier
OL,14,Felsewhere but conditions will improve
OL,15,Fas cloud lifts during the day. Feeling
OL,16,Fvery warm, locally hot in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
